// A land face printed with a mana cost. `cardCostOk` in
// `lean/Semantics/Check/Card.lean` reads `!tys.elem .land` on a front face
// that prints one, so `Card.check` returns `.cardCost` and the gate's
// `decide` refutes the theorem.
SingleFaced(face: (
    characteristics: (
        name: "Lawless Land",
        cost: [Simple(symbol: Generic(amount: 1))],
        types: [Land],
    ),
))
